OL,3,AGerman Chancellor Merz calls state
OL,4,Aelection a 'disaster' for his party but
OL,5,Avows to stay on
OL,6,
OL,7,FIn Berlin, the ruling CDU was also
OL,8,Fexpected to be beaten by Die Linke (The
OL,9,FLeft).
OL,11,FMerz is under mounting pressure, with
OL,12,Fpoor approval ratings and rumours he
OL,13,Fcould even be replaced mid-term in a
OL,14,Fso-called chancellor swap.
